plain: top=1 same=1 len=5 [hello]
empty: top=1 same=1 len=0 []
percent: top=1 same=1 len=11 [100% sure %]
s: top=1 same=1 len=6 [<abc|>]
s null: top=1 same=1 len=8 [<(null)>]
c: top=1 same=1 len=5 [<a ~>]
c ctrl: top=1 same=1 len=3 [<\5>]
c high: top=1 same=1 len=3 [<\200>]
c zero: top=1 same=1 len=2 [<>]
d: top=1 same=1 len=16 [0 -42 2147483647]
d min: top=1 same=1 len=11 [-2147483648]
f: top=1 same=1 len=11 [1.5 1 -0.25]
f big: top=1 same=1 len=19 [1e+100 123456789012]
f small: top=1 same=1 len=9 [1e-10 0.1]
f int-like: top=1 same=1 len=7 [3 1e+15]
f inf: top=1 same=1 len=8 [inf -inf]
p: top=1 nonempty=1
mixed: top=1 same=1 len=11 [k=7 (2.5)%!]
vf: top=1 same=1 len=7 [v-3-0.5]
vf empty: top=1 same=1 len=0 []
long: top=1 len=6002 same=1 head=[abcd
stack: top=3 1 [below] [x]
  bad_option went on: top=2
bad option: status=0: top=1 [a %q b]
bad trailing: status=0: top=1 [x %y]
I option: status=0: top=1 [<%I>]
